erent rooms and locations. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous secrets and Easter eggs to discover. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotional moments that guarantee tears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game <strong>developed</strong>, <strong>written</strong>, <strong>programmed</strong>, and <strong>illustrated</strong> by <strong>Emin Araki</strong>.</p>",
